{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>במועדו</b> plene with vav — after six hours, the time of slaughter. במועדו by alef-tav / bet-shin (Atbash): שיפזק\"ף = בשבת in gematria."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The comment links the plene vav in במועדו to the six-hour slaughter window, then applies Atbash substitution (א→ת, ב→ש, etc.) to במועדו yielding שיפזק\"ף, which equals בשבת in gematria. The phrase 'בא\"ת ב\"ש' denotes the Atbash substitution cipher."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:38.427973921Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}